.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-artifacts-write 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-artifacts\-write \- Write completions, man pages, schemas or the CLI reference where the caller names
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten artifacts write\fR [\fB\-\-completions\fR] [\fB\-\-man\fR] [\fB\-\-schema\fR] [\fB\-\-reference\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write completions, man pages, schemas or the CLI reference where the caller names
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-completions\fR \fI<completions>\fR
Write the bash, zsh and fish completion scripts into this directory
.TP
\fB\-\-man\fR \fI<man>\fR
Write one man page per command into this directory, removing stale pages
.TP
\fB\-\-schema\fR \fI<schema>\fR
Write the config and policy\-input JSON Schemas into this directory
.TP
\fB\-\-reference\fR \fI<reference>\fR
Write the markdown CLI reference to this file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
